Package: fisherscore
Title: Fisher Scoring for Generalized Linear Models
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Grace", "Koo", , "koogc@miamioh.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements Fisher scoring (iteratively reweighted least
    squares) for generalized linear models from scratch, with a pure R
    engine and an RcppArmadillo engine, and tools to compare results and
    speed against stats::glm().
